<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ГЛАВНАЯ — the status pill under the connect object (handoff README §4).

  ONE STRING, and it exists because the prototype's word for the negotiating state is not
  the one this build already had. §4 names the three states «Не подключено» /
  «Подключаемся…» / «Подключено»; the first is @string/home_not_connected and the third
  @string/home_status_connected, both already in the resources and both reused verbatim.
  The middle one is not: @string/home_status_connecting reads «Подключение…» — a noun, the
  name of a process — and it is read by the identity line under the ledger, by the connect
  object's contentDescription and by the shell's own status calls. Rewording it there to
  suit a pill would change four other sentences.

  «Подключаемся…» is the prototype's wording, taken to the character, on the owner's
  instruction of 2026-08-04 («Формулировку бери из прототипа дословно»).

  A file of its own rather than a line appended to strings_home.xml: four screen waves are
  writing at once and strings_home.xml is read by all of them.
-->
<resources>
    <string name="home_pill_connecting">Подключаемся…</string>
</resources>
